## Issue 3 — Launch & Automation Pipeline

### `delivery_launch.py` sequence
```
t=0s   Gazebo Fortress starts (gz sim -r indoor_delivery.sdf)
t=0s   ros_gz_bridge starts (/ultrasonic gz→ros, /cmd_vel ros→gz)
t=3s   rssi_filter starts (sim_mode=True → synthetic sinusoidal RSSI)
t=3s   rssi_navigator starts (all params from launch file)
```

### `run_simulation.sh` features
- Sources `/opt/ros/humble/setup.bash` + workspace overlay
- Launches full system in background, captures PID
- Waits 5 s, then starts `ros2 bag record` on `/filtered_rssi /cmd_vel /ultrasonic/range`
- `trap SIGINT` → clean shutdown of both background processes on Ctrl+C
- Bag saved to `~/ros2_ws/logs/delivery_run_<timestamp>/`

