## RSSI Filter Node — `rssi_filter_node.py`

| Param | Default | Description |
|-------|---------|-------------|
| `filter_type` | `'ema'` | `'ema'` or `'moving_avg'` |
| `sim_mode` | `False` | Synthetic sinusoidal RSSI (no hardware needed) |

**Simulation signal:** −55 dBm ± 10 dBm at 0.2 Hz (5 s/cycle), published at 10 Hz through the same EMA/moving-avg pipeline.

**Watchdog:** if no raw data for 2 s, re-publishes last value with a `WARN` log.

