## Build & Run (on Linux ROS 2 Humble)

```bash
# 1. Copy workspace to Linux
scp -r ros2_ws/ user@ubuntu-host:~/

# 2. Build
cd ~/ros2_ws
colcon build --symlink-install
source install/setup.bash

# 3a. One-command run
chmod +x src/rf_delivery_bot/scripts/run_simulation.sh
bash src/rf_delivery_bot/scripts/run_simulation.sh

# 3b. Manual launch
ros2 launch rf_delivery_bot delivery_launch.py
```

> [!TIP]
> **No real RSSI hardware?** The `rssi_filter` node's `sim_mode=True` (already set in the launch file) generates a synthetic sinusoidal signal — the full pipeline runs without any Wi-Fi/Bluetooth beacon hardware.

