## ROS 2 Topic Map

| Topic | Msg Type | Direction | Publisher | Subscriber |
|-------|----------|-----------|-----------|------------|
| `/raw_rssi` | `std_msgs/Float32` | hardware → ROS | External beacon | `rssi_filter` |
| `/filtered_rssi` | `std_msgs/Float32` | internal | `rssi_filter` | `rssi_navigator` |
| `/ultrasonic/range` | `sensor_msgs/Range` | Gazebo → ROS | `ros_gz_bridge` | `rssi_navigator` |
| `/cmd_vel` | `geometry_msgs/Twist` | ROS → Gazebo | `rssi_navigator` | `ros_gz_bridge` |

